{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46251","headline":"春送赵文观送故合州座主神榇归洛 · 贯休","name":"春送赵文观送故合州座主神榇归洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜继于悲锦水东，还乡仙骑却寻嵩。\n再烧良玉尧云动，方报深恩绦帐空。\n远道灵[輀]春欲尽，乱山羸马恨无穷。\n他年必立吾君侧，好把书绅荅至公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}